      "content": "<p>The number of 6-digit numbers made by using the digits 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, without repetition and which are multiple of 15 is ____________.</p>",
      "options": [],
      "correct_options": [],
      "explanation": "<p>A number is multiple of 15 when the number is divisible by 5 and sum of digits of the number is divisible by 3.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2022 (Online) 30th June Morning Shift Mathematics - Permutations and Combinations Question 119 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l65uqr2z/3aa8732e-2bc7-4c8a-a45b-f53f925f4291/0f4fb6b0-0ee7-11ed-a7de-eff776fdb55c/file-1l65uqr30.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Among 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 unit place is filled with 5 so it is multiple of 5.</p>\n<p>Now to make it divisible by 3, take remaining 5 digits such a way that sum becomes divisible by 3.</p>\n<p>Remaining 5 digits can be</p>\n<p>(1) 1, 2, 3, 4, 6</p>\n<p>Here sum = 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 6 + 5 = 21 (divisible by 3)</p>\n<p>This 5 digits can be filled in those 5 placed without repetition in 5 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 4 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 3 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 2 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1 = 51 = 120 ways</p>\n<p>(2) 2, 3, 4, 6, 7</p>\n<p>Here sum = 2 + 3 + 4 + 6 + 7 + 5 = 27 (divisible by 3)</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Number of ways = 51 = 120</p>\n<p>(3) 1, 2, 3, 6, 7</p>\n<p>Here sum = 1 + 2 + 3 + 6 + 7 + 5 = 24 (divisible by 3)</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Number of ways = 51 = 120</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Total possible 6 digit numbers divisible by 15</p>\n<p>= 120 + 120 + 120 = 360</p>"
